00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.780
My name is Stephen Butschi.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.910
I lead our higher
education team at Google.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:25.320
And this session is on
disaster recovery and storage.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.524
And we've got some
great universities here

00:00:27.524 --> 00:00:28.440
that will be speaking.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.510
But I'm sure you
probably all remember

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.780
