00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:53.159
And the good news is, with
Google Cloud Platform and G

00:00:53.159 --> 00:00:55.230
Suite, we were able
to step in and help

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.600
them recover from this.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.200
But I think what we want
to talk about, hopefully,

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.452
today is helping you avoid what
happened with Hurricane Harvey

00:01:04.452 --> 00:01:06.910
and making sure that you're
thinking through your strategy.

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.784
So as you hear from
these three universities,

00:01:08.784 --> 00:01:11.661
you'll hear a little bit
of the first two buckets.

00:01:11.661 --> 00:01:13.410
So I wanted to call
this out because there

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:17.170
are different types of storage,
the first being G Suite.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:20.250
This we offer for free
to many institutions

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:22.680
that are educational,
in fact, all of them.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:23.940
They're not for profit.

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.620
And so that is
really around file

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:28.150
storage as you think
about backup and recovery,

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:30.060
so things like
essays and manuals

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.220
and presentations,
collaborative docs.

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:34.470
So you'll hear from Steve
from University of Minnesota

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.950
about how they are using Google
Drive for backup and storage

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.970
of those types of materials.

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:42.060
The second bucket is around
Google Cloud Platform

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.720
in our storage classes.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.180
So that is more object storage.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.790
So think about disaster
recovery, large sets

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:50.400
of genomics data, et cetera.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.150
We also have other
types of storage,

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.150
such as block storage
and structured data

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:55.380
through Cloud SQL.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.120
And I put the link
there because there

00:01:57.120 --> 00:02:00.115
